<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 14.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping -- Tuticorin cargoes - Nov 14.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin's port on November 14:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Granite	   5,000/-- (LDD)     --/-- Boris Babochkin  11/11</p>
<p>General	     --/293 (ULD)     --/-- M.V. Schulte     14/11</p>
<p>Urea	     11,175/-- (ULD) 17,304/-- Capetanissa	 7/11</p>
<p>Sulphur	  12,704/-- (ULD)    398/-- Normar Pioneer    1/11</p>
<p>Phos Acid	12,000/-- (ULD)  1,575/-- Thirumalai	 13/11</p>
<p>Coal	     27,057/-- (ULD)  1,942/-- Tamil Periyar    12/11</p>
<p>Cooking Gas     3,100/-- (ULD)  3,000/-- Zallaq	     12/11</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>	   (Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin).</p>
<p>Lloyds Shipping adds:</p>
<p>Tuticorin - one vessel due, 1-2 days berthing delay expected, 3 vessels loading at berth, 4 discharging at berth, 1 waiting at anchorage to load, 2 waiting at anchorage to discharge, 1 survey vessel.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
